   "start": 6.15,
   "end": 15.85,
   "show": "Custom Claude Code skills, built with Remotion. Not built-in commands.",
   "speak": "These are custom Claude Code skills, built with Remotion and animation components. They are not built in commands. Each one is a small folder with instructions.",
   "map": null
  },
  {
   "id": "howto",
   "start": 16.2,
   "end": 23.856,
   "show": "Skills live in .claude/skills. Type /, pick the skill, Claude renders it.",
   "speak": "Skills live in the dot claude skills folder. Type a slash, pick the skill, and Claude follows its instructions to render the result.",
   "map": null
  },
  {
